{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45634","headline":"寄杜使君 · 贯休","name":"寄杜使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清辰卷珠帘，盥漱香满室。\n杉松经雪後，别有精彩出。\n琅函芙蓉书，开之向堦日。\n好鸟常解来，孤云偶相失。\n有时作章句，气概还鲜逸。\n茫茫世情世，谁人爱真实。\n清高慕玄度，宴默攀道一。\n残磬隔风林，微阳解冰笔。\n亦知休明代，谅无经济术。\n门前九个峯，终拟爲文乞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45634.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45634","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}